			<div class="content" id="post-content-4823456">
									

<p>Seeking Greenlights: Yes</p>
<p>Page Type: SCP Article</p>
<p>Genre (Optional): Horror</p>
<p>Elevator Pitch: An 8ft humanoid that was discovered in Denmark with talons, sharp claws, a split jaw, █ █████ that appear to be some sort organic ████ as well as a very thin 4-meter wide cloud of anomalous dust that surrounds the humanoid. This cloud of dust appears to make subjects incredibly drowsy and can be blown towards the nearest subject using the █ █████ on itself and within a 5-second threshold, the affected subjects will fall asleep. Both the humanoid and dust cloud can only be seen when UV rays are shined at them. When asleep the subject will find themselves someplace with sand where the entity will be able to shapeshift using the sand around it into someone that the subject is fond of. Once the entity is spotted by the subject they will be drawn to the entity. When the subject approaches the entity, it will shapeshift into an embodiment of the subject’s worst fears while still embodying one or few of its original traits usually only the split jaw. The entity will then ████████ and ██████ the subject which afterward the subject will wake up. 3 to 8 hours after the subject wakes up all the injuries the subject sustained will happen instantaneously, killing the subject.</p>
<p>Central Narrative: On 9/14/15 from 2 am to 9 am 27 reports were made of people being instantaneously mutilated with what appears to be 3&#160;3-inch ████ █████ on their head. All bodies have been found to have been within a 20-mile radius of Amager Strandpark. On 9/19/15 at 3:55&#160;pm, an 8ft humanoid was discovered to be walking around Amager Strandpark. The entity was later contained that day by █████████.</p>
<p>Hook/Attention-Grabber: Entity based on the Ole Lukøje that connects a subject’s experience in their dream world to reality. &quot;It dragged me into my nightmare where it wished for all to feed its slumbering strength.&quot;</p>
<p>Additional Notes: I’d like feedback especially on how to better word the central narrative and how to make a better hook. When the date the entity was contained is put into the DD/MM/YYYY (a format that some countries in Europe use) would be 19/9/15 (19-9-15) which is a letter cipher for SiO2. SiO2 is the chemical formula for the compound silicon dioxide (the most common component in sand). The other date also has significance. The name will be Mr. Sandman or The Sandman.</p>

							</div>

								
					
